{
 "case": "P02/E04 Anthropic × Messages full and simple options, reasoning mapping and presence",
 "source": "Synthetic offline fixture. Expected requests follow pi-ai 0.87.1 (commit 898ab804050730e9dcefb4443875d5a932aa6a32) packages/ai/src/api/anthropic-messages.ts streamSimple (no reasoning: thinking disabled; forceAdaptiveThinking: mapThinkingLevelToEffort; otherwise adjustMaxTokensForThinking, clampMaxTokensToContext and the 1024-token answer room), buildParams (max_tokens, temperature only without thinking and with supportsTemperature, thinking enabled/adaptive/disabled, output_config, metadata.user_id, tool_choice, getCacheControl) and getBetaFeatures (interleaved thinking for budget-based thinking), and packages/ai/src/api/simple-options.ts buildBaseOptions (samplingParams are merged but Anthropic never sends them). The SDK announces the request timeout as X-Stainless-Timeout in whole seconds.",
 "scenarios": [
  {
   "id": "simple-budget-reasoning",
   "about": "A budget-based model on the simple entry: the level's default budget (medium 8192) is added to the output budget up to the model's maximum, thinking is enabled with pi's summarized display, and the interleaved-thinking beta is requested.",
